    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHINCH\u00d3N \u2013 THE CARD GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinch\u00f3n is part of the Rummy or Gin Rummy family, also known in some countries as Conga, Golpe, or Golpeado.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s the most popular card game in Spain, Argentina, Colombia, Uruguay, and more. With very simple rules, you must combine your 7 cards before your opponents do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a complete tutorial, instructions, in-game help, statistics, and many customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 High-definition cards<br>\u2714 Multiple Spanish deck styles available<br>\u2714 Adjustable card size<br>\u2714 Many HD card backs<br>\u2714 Amazing animations and effects<br>\u2714 Play online with friends or offline against the AI (coming soon)<br>\u2714 Simple and minimalist interface<br>\u2714 Includes a detailed tutorial and full help<br>\u2714 Realistic sounds with adjustable volume<br><br>\u2714 Fully configurable Chinch\u00f3n rules<br>\u2714 Play in vertical or horizontal orientation<br>\u2714 Tons of new features...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Tutorial<br>\u2605 Practice mode (allows undoing moves)<br>\u2605 Single player with 2, 3 or 4 participants (with 4 difficulty levels)<br>\u2605 Online play (coming soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one thing left...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENJOY!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHINCH\u00d3N \u2013 THE CARD GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinch\u00f3n is part of the Rummy or Gin Rummy family, also known in some countries as Conga, Golpe, or Golpeado.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s the most popular card game in Spain, Argentina, Colombia, Uruguay, and more. With very simple rules, you must combine your 7 cards before your opponents do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes a complete tutorial, instructions, in-game help, statistics, and many customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 High-definition cards<br>\u2714 Multiple Spanish deck styles available<br>\u2714 Adjustable card size<br>\u2714 Many HD card backs<br>\u2714 Amazing animations and effects<br>\u2714 Play online with friends or offline against the AI (coming soon)<br>\u2714 Simple and minimalist interface<br>\u2714 Includes a detailed tutorial and full help<br>\u2714 Realistic sounds with adjustable volume<br><br>\u2714 Fully configurable Chinch\u00f3n rules<br>\u2714 Play in vertical or horizontal orientation<br>\u2714 Tons of new features...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAME MODES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2605 Tutorial<br>\u2605 Practice mode (allows undoing moves)<br>\u2605 Single player with 2, 3 or 4 participants (with 4 difficulty levels)<br>\u2605 Online play (coming soon)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one thing left...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENJOY!</strong></p>",
